id: SAVE31-4
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: checkpoint_limit
target: crates/core/src/checkpoint.rs
find:             reason: RefuseReason::CheckpointLimit,
replace:             reason: RefuseReason::UnknownCheckpoint,
expect-fail: the_autosave_after_the_limit_is_skipped_with_one_line
note: 上限の拒否の理由を取り違える（自動保存の見送りの 1 行が上限の行にならない。SAVE-31）
